Material that is NOT included and is read at run time
-----------------------------------------------------
The diagrams and maths in a note are drawn by Mermaid and MathJax. This
project does not contain or redistribute them. When rendering is needed, the
mod reads them from the Obsidian application that the user has installed on
their own machine and copies them into the mod's data folder
(<Herdr home>/data/vault/lib) on that machine only. Those libraries stay under
their own licenses (Mermaid: MIT, MathJax: Apache-2.0) and under Obsidian's
terms for its application files. Without Obsidian installed, notes still open
and diagrams or maths are shown as source text.

Programs started on the user's machine (not included)
-----------------------------------------------------
Depending on the operating system and the feature used, the mods start
ripgrep, Node.js, a Chromium-family browser in headless mode, Poppler's
pdftoppm and pdfinfo, and the system's file opener. None of them is bundled;
each keeps its own license.
